  {
    "episode_id": 74691,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/4/74691.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 156,
    "turn_text": "Now, a lot of people, you know, especially during the election season, we hear about Congress. Well, Congress did do, didn't do, we, there's a lot going on. But I think a lot of people want to know what is it like to be a Congress person? Is it? Are you at the Capitol all day? Do you get to go home a little bit? Like, can you help us understand what is the actual work?",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_06",
