    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/4/74691.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 161,
    "turn_text": "A lot of folks feel like this is glamorous work, and you get all dolled up, you put on a nice suit, and you stand in front of people and they clap for you, and then you go home and have expensive dinners. And it is not that, if you're doing it right, if you're doing it right, it's not that.",
