        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Hope is deeply tied to perceived efficacy of individual actions in political systems.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "The emotional toll of disillusionment after long-term activism warrants empathetic response.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "People expect tangible outcomes from collective political participation.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Disillusionment undermines motivation to continue civic involvement.",
