    "turn_text": "Well, that's it. Thanks so much for tuning in to Potsay the People this week. Don't forget to follow us at Cricut Media on Instagram, Twitter, and TikTok. And if you enjoyed this episode of Potsay the People, consider dropping us a review on your favorite podcast set. And we'll see you next week. Potsay the People is a production of Cricut Media. It's produced by A.J. Moultrie and mixed by Basilis Fotopoulos. Executive produced by me and special thanks to our weekly contributors, Kai Henderson, D.R. Ballinger, and Miles E. Johnson.",
